{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1321425001:1":{"text":"이 부적을 잊지 말고 가져가세요! 이건 선조께서 남겨주신 유물이에요!","source_cn":"喏，别忘了带走这个护身符！这可是先祖留给你们的遗物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968E7D31AEAF1CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321425002:1":{"text":"고마워요. 잘 간직할게요.","source_cn":"谢谢，我一定会好好保存的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D97532510084EC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321425003:1":{"text":"마을로 돌아가면, 피터와 함께 성씨를 다시 카민스키로 바꾸고 저희 힘으로 인정을 받아 선조의 명예를 되찾겠어요.","source_cn":"等回到镇上，我会和彼得改回卡明斯基这个姓氏，靠自己的努...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91A5D78DCFB8444F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321425004:1":{"text":"물론 살아있는 시체에 대해서도 모두에게 알릴 거예요. 무명의 영웅들이 써내려간 업적을 알려서 그들이 더는 악마의 권속으로 여겨지지 않게 하겠어요.","source_cn":"当然，我也会把活死人的事告诉大家，让更多人知道这些无名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA08966726B7B803","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321425005:1":{"text":"그럼 술은 이제 그만 마셔야겠네!","source_cn":"那你不能再喝酒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5DE2E09FF75E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321425006:1":{"text":"물론이지. 오늘부터 한 방울도 안 마실게.","source_cn":"没问题，从今天开始，一滴也不会再碰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x921335C4CB5237BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321425007:1":{"text":"카민스키 가문의 후손이라면, 선조의 용기를 이어받아 절대 해이해져서는 안 되니까!","source_cn":"卡明斯基的后裔，当然要继承先祖的英勇，绝不会颓废度日！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE96003CA158430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯捷潘":{"text":"스테판","source":"斯捷潘","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"피터","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}